"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:6ccd02128225b6a95beecf3e7497e57009d05d0465eac85ddb72f0eddcc5b62a","file":"preprints/Entanglement-with-zero-distillable-secret-key-in-local-dimension-ten-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex","line":80,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"8b91d2db6928f6f3be3d749662ac48d7c16502cb3a344a5c505179cae8ec6a20","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Entanglement-with-zero-distillable-secret-key-in-local-dimension-ten-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:6ccd02128225b6a95beecf3e7497e57009d05d0465eac85ddb72f0eddcc5b62a","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Entanglement-with-zero-distillable-secret-key-in-local-dimension-ten-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex#L80"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main-pair}\nThere are explicitly specified PPT maps\n$\\Phi_1,\\Phi_2:\\Mat{10}\\to\\Mat{10}$ for which\n\\[\n Z=J(\\Phi_2\\circ\\Phi_1)\n\\]\nis nonzero and its range contains no nonzero product vector in\n$\\C^{10}\\otimes\\C^{10}$.  In particular, the composition\n$\\Phi_2\\circ\\Phi_1$ is not entanglement breaking."}
